1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,428
Doston ki naukri lag gayi, meri abhi tak nahi.

2
00:00:03,728 --> 00:00:08,925
Golu, poora sheher kis cheez ke liye line lagata hai? Golgappe! Thela laga!

3
00:00:09,225 --> 00:00:11,744
Golgappe? Usme kitna kharcha aayega?

4
00:00:12,044 --> 00:00:15,137
Thela, matke, bartan, sab 15 hazaar mein.

5
00:00:15,437 --> 00:00:21,272
Safai rakhna! Dastaane pehno, paani filter ka. Saaf thele pe bheed dugni lagti hai.

6
00:00:21,822 --> 00:00:24,643
Bhaiya, teekha wala! Aur last mein sookhi puri free!

7
00:00:24,943 --> 00:00:29,278
Chhe golgappe, 40 rupaye. Sookhi puri aapke liye free, madam!

8
00:00:29,578 --> 00:00:35,356
Shaam ke 4 ghante, 100 plate. Aadha munafa, yaani ₹1,500 se ₹2,000 roz.

9
00:00:35,656 --> 00:00:42,107
Dahi puri aur chaat bhi rakho. Aur shaadi-party ke order lo, wahan ek din mein hafte ki kamai.

10
00:00:42,407 --> 00:00:45,565
Golu ke golgappe, full demand mein! Life set!
